Description: Allow bundled libnotify-qt to configure with Noble CMake
 Ubuntu 24.04 ships CMake 3.28.3. The bundled libnotify-qt subproject declares
 CMake 4.0 even though its embedded Qt 6 build path works with Noble's CMake.
 Lower the minimum to 3.28 for the vendored build used by Whatsie.
Author: Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-13

--- a/src/libnotify-qt/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/src/libnotify-qt/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 4.0)
+cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.28)

 set(NotifyQt_MAJOR_VERSION 1)
 set(NotifyQt_MINOR_VERSION 0)
